{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"antlr","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"ANTLR","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for ANTLR (.g4 .g).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"antlr","name":"ANTLR","extensions":[".g4",".g"],"grammar":"grammars/antlr.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"ANTLR","path":"snippets/antlr.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/antlr.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[a-z][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*(?:\\\\[[^\\\\]]*\\\\])?\\\\s*:)\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"->|[|*+?~]|\\\\.\\\\.|#\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\[[^\\\\]]*\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\{[^}]*\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:channels|fragment|pushMode|grammar|options|returns|finally|popMode|channel|parser|import|tokens|locals|throws|lexer|catch|mode|skip|more|type)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/antlr.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Grammar\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"grammar\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"grammar ${1:Name};\",\n      \"\",\n      \"${2:start}: ${3:expr} EOF;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A grammar header\"\n  },\n  \"Parser rule\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rule\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:expr}: ${2:term} (${3:'+'} ${2:term})*;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A parser rule\"\n  },\n  \"Lexer rule\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tok\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:ID}: [a-zA-Z_] [a-zA-Z_0-9]*;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A lexer rule\"\n  },\n  \"Skip whitespace\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ws\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"WS: [ \\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\n]+ -> skip;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Skip whitespace\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# ANTLR\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for ANTLR.\n\n## Files\n\n`.g4`, `.g`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `grammar` | A grammar header |\n| `rule` | A parser rule |\n| `tok` | A lexer rule |\n| `ws` | Skip whitespace |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}